<opt:body xmlns:opt="https://www.openpower.tools/ns/opt">
      <p>A collapsible hierarchy for partition layouts and device trees. Branches are
      native details and summary pairs, so collapsing works without wasm and stays
      keyboard-accessible; leaves are plain list items.</p>
      <h2>Example</h2>
      <opt:tree>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <details open="">
              <summary>PNOR flash layout</summary>
              <ul>
                <li><code>HBB</code> Hostboot base, 512 KiB</li>
                <li><code>HBI</code> Hostboot extended image</li>
                <li>
                  <details>
                    <summary><code>PAYLOAD</code> Skiboot</summary>
                    <ul>
                      <li><code>skiboot.lid</code> OPAL runtime services</li>
                    </ul>
                  </details>
                </li>
                <li><code>BOOTKERNFW</code> Petitboot kernel, 16 MiB</li>
              </ul>
            </details>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </opt:tree>
      <h2>Markup</h2>
      <pre>&lt;opt:tree&gt;
  &lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;PNOR&lt;/summary&gt;
      &lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;HBB&lt;/code&gt; 512 KiB&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
    &lt;/details&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/opt:tree&gt;</pre>

</opt:body>
